      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ادرن</span></b> : see 1. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also <i>He rendered</i> a garment
<i>dirty,</i> or <i>filthy:</i> (S, K:) or <i>he defiled, polluted,</i>
or <i>smeared,</i> a garment <i>with dirt,</i> or <i>filth.</i> (K.) ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَدْرَنَتِ الإِبِلُ</span> <i>The camels fed upon what is
termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَرِين</span>: (M, K:) thus they do in the case
of drought, or sterility. (M.)

